{
  "_comment": [
    "The GitHub Pages demo link (pages/build.ts, .github/workflows/pages.yml). Every build packs the same",
    "input with these keys, so the link and its files never change, and fails if an input file, a study",
    "file's plaintext or ciphertext, the Bundle or the link differs from what is recorded here.",
    "A file key must never encrypt different bytes (spec/README.md section 13). To change the input or",
    "siteUrl, edit source or siteUrl and run `bun pages/build.ts --new-keys`: it draws a new link key,",
    "Bundle IV, file ids and file keys, and records them with the new hashes. The link then changes.",
    "These keys are public: the link itself carries the link key, and the Bundle carries the file keys.",
    "segment names the link's folder under demo-links/ (256 random bits, as the SHL specification requires of the link's url); --new-keys draws it too."
  ],
